    "prompt": "Crea un componente web interactivo para 'Dalila Velvet' utilizando HTML, CSS y JavaScript.",
    "html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"es-MX\">\n\n<head>\n <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n <title>Dalila Velvet :: Drag Queen :: La perra más alta de Colombia</title>\n <meta name=\"description\" content=\"Dalila Veltet, la perra más alta de Colombia. Drag Queen. Periodista, travesti y boba hijueputa. Dragvesti\">\n <meta name=\"author \" content=\"@LuisAngelMaciel \">\n <meta name=\"generator \" content=\"@LuisAngelMaciel\">\n <!--    <script src=\"js/lkh0ago.js\"></script>\n    <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/meyer-reset/2.0/reset.min.css\" rel=\"preconnect \"> -->\n <script>\n  try {\n   Typekit.load({\n    async: true\n   });\n  } catch (e) {}\n </script>\n <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://luisangelmaciel.github.io/dalilavelvet/css/linktree.css\">\n <!-- Twitter body -->\n <meta name=\"twitter:widgets:autoload\" content=\"off\">\n <link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://luisangelmaciel.github.io/dalilavelvet\">\n <link rel=\"me \" href=\"https://twitter.com/DalilaVelvet_\">\n <meta name=\"twitter:widgets:border-color\" content=\"#343434\">\n <meta name=\"twitter:widgets:theme \" content=\"dark\">\n <meta name=\"twitter:dnt\" content=\"on\">\n <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n <script src=\"https://luisangelmaciel.github.io/js/lazysizes.min.js \" async></script>\n</head>\n<style>\n @import url(\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Work+Sans:wght@900&display=swap\");\n\n * {\n  box-sizing: border-box;\n }\n\n *::before,\n *::after {\n  box-sizing: border-box;\n }\n\n body {\n  margin: 0;\n  background: #f2f0ed;\n }\n\n .container {\n  display: inline-flex;\n  justify-content: center;\n  align-items: center;\n  width: 100%;\n  min-height: 100vh;\n  font-family: \"Work Sans\", sans-serif;\n  font-size: 1em;\n }\n\n a {\n  text-decoration: none;\n }\n\n .link {\n  z-index: 1;\n  position: relative;\n  display: inline-block;\n  font-size: 3em;\n  color: #808080;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  transition: color 275ms ease;\n }\n\n .link:hover {\n  color: #333;\n }\n\n .link:hover~.hover-container .link-text {\n  opacity: 1;\n }\n\n .link:hover~.hover-container .image-container {\n  opacity: 1;\n }\n\n .link-text {\n  z-index: 2;\n  position: absolute;\n  display: flex;\n  justify-content: center;\n  align-items: center;\n  top: 0;\n  left: 0;\n  right: 0;\n  bottom: 0;\n  font-size: 3em;\n  color: #fff;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  pointer-events: none;\n  -webkit-clip-path: circle(75px at var(--x) var(--y));\n  clip-path: circle(75px at var(--x) var(--y));\n  opacity: 0;\n  transition: opacity 250ms ease;\n }\n\n .image-container {\n  z-index: -2;\n  position: absolute;\n  top: 0;\n  left: 0;\n  width: 300px;\n  height: 300px;\n  opacity: 0;\n  transition: opacity 250ms ease;\n }\n\n .image-inner {\n  position: absolute;\n  top: -75px;\n  left: -75px;\n  width: 300px;\n  height: 300px;\n }\n\n .link-image {\n  display: block;\n  max-width: 100%;\n  width: 300px;\n  height: 300px;\n  -o-object-fit: cover;\n  object-fit: cover;\n  -o-object-position: center;\n  object-position: center;\n  border-radius: 50%;\n  filter: brightness(0.9);\n }\n</style>\n\n<body>\n\n <div class=\"container\">\n  <a class=\"link\" href=\"https://www.instagram.com/dalilavelvet/\" target=\"_blank\" title=\" Dalila Veltet, la perra más alta de Colombia \">Dalila Velvet</a>\n  <span class=\"hover-container\">\n   <span class=\"link-text\" aria-hidden=\"true\">Dalila Velvet</span>\n   <span class=\"image-container\">\n    <span class=\"image-inner\">\n     <img class=\"link-image\" src=\"https://luisangelmaciel.github.io/dalilavelvet/img/dalila-velvet.jpg\" alt=\"Dalila Velvet\" />\n    </span>\n   </span>\n  </span>\n </div>\n\n <script src=\"https://luisangelmaciel.github.io/dalilavelvet/js/name-dalilavelvet.js\"></script>\n\n <div class=\"body-linktree \">\n  <main class='profile' ontouchstart>\n   <div class='background'></div>\n   <aside class='avatar'></aside>\n   <section class='info'>\n    <h1 class=\"work-sans \">Contacto</h1>\n    <h2>Ridiculous Queen</h2>\n    <a href=\"https://twitter.com/intent/follow?screen_name=DalilaVelvet_ \" class='follow'>La perra más alta de Colombia</a>\n    <ul>\n     <li>\n      <a href='https://www.facebook.com/dalivelvet' target='_blank'>\n       <img src=\"https://luisangelmaciel.github.io/dalilavelvet/img/facebook-azul-letra.svg \" width=\"45px \" height=\"45px \" alt=\"Facebook de la Periodista, travesti y boba hijueputa, Dalila Veltet \" title=\"Facebook de la Periodista, travesti y boba hijueputa, Dalila Veltet \" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"lazyload  \">\n      </a>\n     </li>\n     <li>\n      <a href='https://www.instagram.com/dalilavelvet/' target='_blank'>\n       <img src=\"https://luisangelmaciel.github.io/dalilavelvet/img/instagram.svg \" width=\"45px \" height=\"45px \" alt=\"Ve al Instagram de Dalila Veltet, la perra más alta de Colombia \" title=\"Ve al Instagram de Dalila Veltet, la perra más alta de Colombia\" loading=\" lazy \" class=\"lazyload \"\">\n                        </a>\n                    </li>\n                    <li>\n                        <a href=\" https://twitter.com/intent/follow?screen_name=DalilaVelvet_ \">\n                            <img src=\" https://luisangelmaciel.github.io/dalilavelvet/img/twitter-bird.svg \" width=\" 45px \" height=\" 45px \" alt=\" Twitter de la Periodista, travesti y boba hijueputa, Dalila Veltet \" title=\" Twitter de la Periodista, travesti y boba hijueputa, Dalila Veltet \" loading=\" lazy \" class=\" lazyload \"\">\n      </a>\n     </li>\n    </ul>\n   </section>\n  </main>\n </div>\n\n <script src='https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/jquery/3.5.0/jquery.min.js' type=\"text/javascript \" async></script>\n <script src=\"https://luisangelmaciel.github.io/dalilavelvet/js/linktree.js \"></script>\n\n</body>\n\n</html>",
