    "html": "<title>Pen Export Onrwpmq</title>\n<add-to-calendar-button name=\"Descarga el calendario Eventhunt\" description=\"365 días contigo (bueno, y 366 cada 4 años) \" startDate=\"2024-08-18\" startTime=\"10:15\" endTime=\"17:45\" timeZone=\"America/Mexico_City\" location=\"World Wide Web\" organizer=\"Xbr|xbr.pw@my.com\" icsFile=\"https://calendar.google.com/calendar/u/0?cid=M2YxcGI2azZ0dHVycmFvc3NkM3IxZ21pdXNAZ3JvdXAuY2FsZW5kYXIuZ29vZ2xlLmNvbQ\" availability=\"busy\" subscribe options=\"'Apple','Google','iCal','Outlook.com','Yahoo','MicrosoftTeams','Microsoft365'\" buttonStyle=\"round\" size=\"5\" label=\"Agrega Eventhunt a Google Calendar\" lightMode=\"bodyScheme\" language=\"es\"></add-to-calendar-button><br>\n\n<add-to-calendar-button name=\"[Reminder] Test the Add to Calendar Button\" startDate=\"2024-07-27\" startTime=\"10:15\" endTime=\"23:30\" timeZone=\"America/Los_Angeles\" description=\"Check out the maybe easiest way to include Add to Calendar Buttons to your web projects:[br]→ [url]https://www.xbr.pw/|Click here![/url]\" options=\"Google\" lightMode=\"bodyScheme\"></add-to-calendar-button>\n\n<add-to-calendar-button name=\"Event Series\" dates='[\n    {\n      \"name\":\"Reminder 1/3 to test the Add to Calendar Button\",\n      \"description\":\"This is the first part to check the Add to Calendar Button script at [url]https://www.xbr.pw/[/url]\",\n      \"startDate\":\"today+3\",\n      \"startTime\":\"10:15\",\n      \"endTime\":\"23:30\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"name\":\"Reminder 3/3 to test the Add to Calendar Button\",\n      \"description\":\"This is the third part to check the Add to Calendar Button script at [url]https://www.xbr.pw/[/url]\",\n      \"startDate\":\"today+8\",\n      \"startTime\":\"09:00\",\n      \"endTime\":\"19:00\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"name\":\"Reminder 2/3 to test the Add to Calendar Button\",\n      \"description\":\"This is the second part to check the Add to Calendar Button script at [url]https://www.xbr.pw/[/url]\",\n      \"startDate\":\"today+5\",\n      \"startTime\":\"11:30\",\n      \"endTime\":\"20:00\"\n    }\n  ]' timeZone=\"America/Mexico_City\" location=\"World Wide Web\" options=\"'Apple','Google','iCal','Outlook.com','Microsoft 365','Microsoft Teams','Yahoo'\" label=\"Programa tu cita\" inline listStyle=\"modal\" lightMode=\"bodyScheme\"></add-to-calendar-button>\n\n<add-to-calendar-button name=\"Event Series\" dates='[\n    {\n      \"name\":\"Evento 1/3 \"Taller interesante sobre algo\"\",\n      \"description\":\"Esta es la primera opción para agregar al calendario. Checklist [url]https://www.xbr.pw/[/url]\",\n      \"startDate\":\"today+3\",\n      \"startTime\":\"10:15\",\n      \"endTime\":\"23:30\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"name\":\"Evento 2/3 \"Otro taller sobre otra cosa interesante\",\n      \"description\":\"Este es la segunda opción para seleccionar con algun link por si lo deseas [url]https://www.xbr.pw/[/url]\",\n      \"startDate\":\"today+8\",\n      \"startTime\":\"09:00\",\n      \"endTime\":\"19:00\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"name\":\"Reminder 2/3 to test the Add to Calendar Button\",\n      \"description\":\"This is the second part to check the Add to Calendar Button script at [url]https://www.xbr.pw/[/url]\",\n      \"startDate\":\"today+5\",\n      \"startTime\":\"11:30\",\n      \"endTime\":\"20:00\"\n    }\n  ]' timeZone=\"America/Mexico_City\" location=\"World Wide Web\" options=\"'Apple','Google','iCal','Outlook.com','Microsoft 365','Microsoft Teams','Yahoo'\" buttonsList hideTextLabelButton buttonStyle=\"round\" listStyle=\"overlay\" lightMode=\"bodyScheme\"></add-to-calendar-button>\nSí. El botón Agregar al calendario en su versión de código abierto es de uso gratuito para todos. Puede usarlo para sus proyectos personales y para su negocio. ¡\nEsto incluso está garantizado por el Programa de Archivo de GitHub !\nDe todos modos, tenga en cuenta la licencia, que está disponible en el repositorio de código .\nEn resumen, es gratuito siempre y cuando no elimine la información de derechos de autor y no cree su propia solución de uso compartido de eventos administrados sobre él.\n<a href=\"https://add-to-calendar-button.com/examples\">Examples</a><br><a href=\"https://add-to-calendar-button.com/advanced-use#case-5\">Avanzados</a>\n<add-to-calendar-button name=\"Title\" options=\"'Apple','Google', 'iCal','Outlook.com','Yahoo'\" location=\"World Wide Web\" startDate=\"2024-08-07\" endDate=\"2024-08-07\" startTime=\"10:15\" endTime=\"23:30\" timeZone=\"America/Los_Angeles\" label=\"Programa tu cita\"></add-to-calendar-button>\n<script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/ add-to-calendar-button@2\" async defer></script>\n\n<add-to-calendar-button name=\"[Reminder] Test the Add to Calendar Button\" startDate=\"2024-08-07\" startTime=\"10:15\" endTime=\"23:30\" timeZone=\"America/Los_Angeles\" location=\"World Wide Web\" description=\"Check out the maybe easiest way to include Add to Calendar Buttons to your web projects:[br]→ [url]https://www.xbr.pw/|Click here![/url]\" options=\"'Apple','Google','iCal','Outlook.com','Yahoo'\" label=\"Click me hard!\" inline listStyle=\"modal\" lightMode=\"bodyScheme\"></add-to-calendar-button>",
