    "prompt": "Diseña una landing page responsiva, moderna y visualmente atractiva. Agrega secciones de hero con botones de llamado a la acción (CTA), características clave, testimonios y un pie de página estético.",
    "html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Vetsie App Landing Page</title>\n    <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"style.css\">\n</head>\n<body>\n    <section class=\"main\">\n        <nav>\n            <img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/q7YcnW3s/logo.png\" alt=\"logo\" class=\"logo\">\n\n            <ul class=\"menu\">\n                <li><a href=\"#\" class=\"menu-download\">Download</a></li>\n                <li><a href=\"#\" class=\"menu-buy\">Buy Vetsie</a></li>\n            </ul>\n        </nav>\n\n        <div class=\"container\">\n            <div class=\"main-text\">\n                <h1>Modernizing Veterinary Care <span> for Pets </span></h1>\n                <p>Reimagine how you communicate with your clients</p>\n                <div class=\"wrapper-img\">\n                    <img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/cCptL8rw/app1.png\" alt=\"image\">\n                    <img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/nz5C3QKg/app2.png\" alt=\"image\">\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"main-img\">\n                <img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/DfrJK5hy/2.png\" alt=\"image\">\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n</body>\n</html>",
    "css": "@import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Poppins:ital,wght@0,100;0,200;0,300;0,400;0,500;0,600;0,700;0,800;0,900;1,100;1,200;1,300;1,400;1,500;1,600;1,700;1,800;1,900&display=swap');\n\n*{\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n    list-style: none;\n    text-decoration: none;\n    font-family: \"Poppins\", sans-serif;\n}\n\n.main{\n    width: 100%;\n    height: 100vh;\n    background-color: #f1f4f5;\n}\n\n.logo{ height: 70px; }\n\nnav{\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    padding: 20px 5%;\n}\n\n.menu{\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: center;\n    align-items: center;\n}\n\n    .menu li a{\n        margin: 0px 5px;\n        font-size: .8rem;\n        letter-spacing: 1px;\n    }\n\n.menu-download, .menu-buy{ \n    padding: 12px 25px;\n    border-radius: 4px;\n    font-weight: 500;\n }\n\n    .menu-download{\n        background-color: #fff;\n        color: #111;\n        box-shadow: 2px 2px 18px rgba(0, 0, 0, .1);\n        transition: .5s all ease;        \n    }\n\n        .menu-download:hover{\n            background-color: #f08030;\n            color: #fff;\n        }\n\n\n    .menu-buy{\n        background-color: #f08030;\n        color: #fff;\n        box-shadow: 2px 2px 18px rgba(0, 0, 0, .2);\n        transition: .5s all ease;\n    }\n\n        .menu-buy:hover{ background-color: #f19654; }\n\n.container{\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n}\n\n.main-text h1{\n    width: 380px;\n    font-size: 2.5rem;\n}\n\n.main-text p{\n    width: 350px;\n    font-size: 16px;\n    margin-top: 12px;\n}\n\n.main-text img{\n    height: 45px;\n    margin-top: 24px;\n}\n\nspan{ color: #f08030; }\n\n@media (max-width: 912px){\n    .container { flex-direction: column-reverse;}\n\n    .main-img img{ height: 380px; }\n\n    .main-text h1{ \n        padding-top: 50px;\n        text-align: center;\n    }\n\n    .main-text p{ text-align: center;}\n\n    .wrapper-img{ \n        display: flex;\n        justify-content: space-between;}\n}\n\n@media (max-width: 418px){\n\n    .main-img img{ height: 280px; }\n\n    .main-text h1{ \n        width: 350px;\n        font-size: 2rem;\n    }\n\n    .main-text p{\n        font-size: 15px;\n        font-weight: 400;\n    }\n\n    .menu-download{ display: none; }\n\n    .wrapper-img{ justify-content: space-evenly;}\n    \n}",
    "js": ""
